WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:10.080
You still see her sometimes, don't you?

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.360
Your sister?

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.840
No, sweetheart.
Not for a very long time.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.060
I saw her again the other day.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.200
It was her. I know it.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.320
You really want me to believe that that's her?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.520
You don't see the resemblance?

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.960
To a dead four-year-old girl? No.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.440
I saw the way you looked at her.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.600
I saw you! Mom!

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.880
You more than anyone..

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.620
You have to believe!

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:59.740
I really think you need to let this go now.

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:03.860
Your sister was a very old soul.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:11.780
Sometimes we just don't come back.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.180
I don't know how to fix this.
I don't know...

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.360
if there is any way to fix this anymore.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.060
I wish you were here...

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.080
because I think you'd know what to do.

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:35.120
And I think I'd listen to you.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:41.140
I think you're the only one I'd listen to.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.660
But...

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.060
you're not here.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.480
I missed you.

